# Key material. This repo handles ed25519 signing keys via the vault extra
# (credentials_vault.py), so unlike most of the fleet it does have a reason for these.
# Note that the standard's *.key rule is under review (vikunja#630) — 44 of 52 repos fail it
# and no incident is cited. Adding it here is one repo conforming to a live rule, not an
# argument that the rule should survive that review.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Core dumps
core.*
*.core

# Logs
*.log
